[00:17.99]Yeah!
[00:23.15]
[00:34.59]How's the view up on your throne today
{"今日王座上的风景可好"}
[00:37.47]Are you ruling with an iron fist?
{"你正用铁腕统治着吗"}
[00:41.82]Rejoice in your sickness
